   "status": "open",
   "urgency": "normal",
   "title": "Which caching header for the assets?",
   "body": "The assets carry a hash in their name, so they never change under one address. Today they are served like this:\n\n```\nCache-Control: no-cache\nETag: \"5f3a\"\n```\n\nThat costs a round trip per file on every visit.\n\n- `immutable` tells the browser never to ask again\n- a year is the longest most proxies honour\n- the page itself must stay `no-cache`, or a deploy is not seen",
   "options": [
